{"product_id":"from-slave-to-soldier-based-on-a-true-civil-war-story-ready-to-read-level-3","title":"From Slave to Soldier: Based on a True Civil War Story (Ready-to-Read Level 3)","description":"\u003cp\u003eJohnny loves his uncle and his master's mule, but he hates being a slave. So when he's asked to join the Union army, he accepts. Being a soldier is hard work, and Johnny wonders if he made the right choice. But when the army needs him, Johnny knows it's up to him to come to the rescue!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 229\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Deborah Hopkinson\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780689839665\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 48\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738248470681,"sku":"5RD9780689839665","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68cf918d62e99_From_Slave_to_Soldier-_Based_on_a_True_Civil_War_Story__Ready-to-Read_Level_3__Deborah_Hopkinson.jpg?v=1758560120","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/from-slave-to-soldier-based-on-a-true-civil-war-story-ready-to-read-level-3","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}